            "detailed_description": "The rich folklore continues with this exciting tale set in an old Slavic land. As Child of Spring, can you save the world from eternal winter?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA cruel and cold Goddess of Winter has hijacked springtime, and her victim has called on you for help. You'll be surprised by what you, a lowly peasant, can do in the face of evil – and what cute little furry friends you’ll meet along the way in Myths of the World: Stolen Spring.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won’t find in the standard version. The Collector's Edition includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore your legacy in the bonus game<br />\r\nBuy pet toys and treats with coins<br />\r\nEarn achievements as you play<br />\r\nSoundtracks, wallpapers, screensavers and art<br />\r\nIntegrated Strategy Guide",
